WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.325
Before a live run reads anything,
the kit checks who it's signed in as.

2
00:00:04.325 --> 00:00:08.700
It asks AWS's security token service
for the caller's identity, once,

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.712
and refuses a caller whose identity
isn't in the partition the settings name.

4
00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:16.638
The region is that partition's
Health endpoint region.

5
00:00:16.638 --> 00:00:21.357
When the tool fails, for example with
the subscription-required error,

6
00:00:21.357 --> 00:00:23.799
the error surfaces in AWS's own words.

7
00:00:23.799 --> 00:00:27.476
The tests pin all of this: six
in the collector's AWS block,

8
00:00:27.476 --> 00:00:30.833
plus the live tests for
the endpoint per partition,

9
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:35.860
the eleven-identifier refusal, the
caller guard and the support-plan error.
